      "id": "p0019-b001",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "\"The other day, someone mistook the word 'hospital' for 'hair salon' and asked for a shampoo and haircut. We speak in hiragana, so I guess that sort of thing is bound to happen sometimes.\"",
        "raw": "\"The other day, someone mistook\nthe word 'hospital' for 'hair salon'\nand asked for a shampoo and\nhaircut. We speak in hiragana, so\nI guess that sort of thing is bound\nto happen sometimes.\"",
