      "id": "p0019-b002",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "\"One person requested a 'shampoo and cut.' They must have thought that a 'bad hair day' could be treated at the hospital. Either that or they wanted their medical insurance to cover their grooming.\"",
